    """Analyze lizard symptoms and return suspected diseases.

    Parameters
    ----------
    symptoms:
        A list of symptom identifier strings.
    age_stage:
        Optional age stage descriptor.
    breed:
        Optional species/morph; included for interface compatibility.

    Returns
    -------
    dict
        Analysis result in the standard differential diagnosis format.
    """
